1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:14,656
Writing, task one. Form number 17. You lost your documents and go to the police. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:17,271
Which documents did you lose?

3
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:32,276
I lost my passport, residence permit and driving licence, they were in my wallet.

4
00:00:33,167 --> 00:00:35,127
Where and when did you lose them?

5
00:00:45,533 --> 00:00:49,161
I lost them yesterday afternoon on tram number nine on my way from work.

6
00:00:50,067 --> 00:00:52,651
What did you do when you found out you didn't have them?

7
00:01:03,067 --> 00:01:07,109
I immediately called the transport company and then blocked my bank card.

8
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:17,861
Fill in form 17 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
